ant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KITAZAKI, YASUAKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NICHIBAN CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOKUMURA, FUMIO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KITAZAKI YASUAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOKUMURA FUMIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KITAZAKI, YASUAKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOKUMURA, FUMIO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A medical pressure-sensitive adhesive tape having a base material and an adhesive layer formed on at least one surface thereof, characterized in that it has (a) a stress at 5 % elongation as measured at 23 DEG C and at an elongation speed of 100 mm/min of the range of 0.1 to 8.0 N/24 mm, (b) a viscosity of the adhesive in the layer (unit: Pa•s) as determined from an initial shear by a shearing load of the range of 5.0 to 6.7, and (c) a moisture permeability as measured at 40 DEG C and a relative humidity of 90% of the range of 800 to 8,000 g/m&lt;2&gt;•24 hr.  The tape is significantly reduced with respect to irritant action to a skin.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un ruban adhésif médical sensible à la pression constitué d'un matériau de base et d'une couche adhésive formée sur une surface au moins dudit matériau. Ledit ruban est caractérisé par (a) une résistance, à un allongement de 5 % mesuré à 23  DEG C et à une vitesse d'allongement de 100mm/min, comprise entre 0,1 et 8,0 N/24 mm, (b) une viscosité au niveau de la couche adhésive (unité : Pa.s) telle que déterminée à partir du cisaillement initial exercé par une force de cisaillement comprise entre 5,0 et 6,7, et (c) une perméabilité à l'humidité mesurée à 40  DEG C et à une humidité relative de 90 %, comprise entre 800 et 8000 g/m&lt;2&gt;.24 hr. Ledit ruban est sensiblement moins irritant pour la peau.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>